#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reducing circuit depth with the AQC-Tensor Qiskit addon"
msgstr "Pagbawas ng circuit depth gamit ang AQC-Tensor Qiskit addon"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/aqc-"
"tensor/01_initial_state_aqc.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/aqc-"
"tensor/01_initial_state_aqc.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this notebook, we will work through the steps of a [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) while "
"using **approximate quantum compilation with tensor networks (AQC-Tensor)** "
"to achieve a lower circuit depth than would ordinarily be needed to perform "
"Trotter evolution.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa notebook na ito, dadaan tayo sa mga hakbang ng isang [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) habang"
" ginagamit ang **approximate quantum compilation gamit ang tensor networks "
"(AQC-Tensor)** upang makamit ang mas mababang circuit depth kaysa sa "
"karaniwang kakailanganin para magsagawa ng Trotter evolution.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take:\n"
msgstr "Ito ang mga hakbang na gagawin natin:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map to quantum problem**\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 1: I-map sa quantum problem**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize our problem's Hamiltonian and observable(s)\n"
msgstr "I-initialize ang Hamiltonian at observable(s) ng ating problema\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Generate a target tensor-network state for the initial"
" portion of the circuit</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Bumuo ng target tensor-network state para sa inisyal "
"na bahagi ng circuit</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Generate a low-depth circuit which approximates the "
"portion being compressed</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Bumuo ng low-depth circuit na nag-aapproximate sa "
"bahaging kinukompres</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Generate a general ansatz from that circuit</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Bumuo ng general ansatz mula sa circuit na "
"iyon</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Optimize the parameters to bring the ansatz as close "
"as possible to the target</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>I-optimize ang mga parameter upang dalhin ang ansatz "
"nang kasinglapit hangga't maaari sa target</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Add subsequent Trotter steps to the optimized "
"ansatz</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Magdagdag ng mga sumusunod na Trotter step sa "
"optimized na ansatz</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware**\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 2: I-optimize para sa target hardware**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the circuit for hardware\n"
msgstr "I-transpile ang circuit para sa hardware\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute experiments**\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 3: Isagawa ang mga eksperimento**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a fake backend for simplicity\n"
msgstr "Gumamit ng fake backend para sa pagiging simple\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Reconstruct results**\n"
msgstr "**Hakbang 4: I-reconstruct ang mga resulta**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "N/A; instead, we just output the measured observable\n"
msgstr "N/A; sa halip, ino-output lang natin ang sinukat na observable\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map to quantum circuit and operator {#step-1-map-to-quantum-circuit-"
"and-operator}"
msgstr ""
"Hakbang 1: Map sa quantum circuit at operator {#step-1-map-to-quantum-"
"circuit-and-operator}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up a model Hamiltonian and observable {#set-up-a-model-hamiltonian-and-"
"observable}"
msgstr ""
"I-set up ang isang model Hamiltonian at observable {#set-up-a-model-"
"hamiltonian-and-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this notebook, we use the Ising model on a circle of 10 sites:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{\\text{Ising}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{10} J_{i,(i+1)} Z_i Z_{(i+1)} + h_i X_i \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"
"where the periodic boundary conditions imply that for $i=10$ we obtain $i+1=11\\rightarrow1$, $J$ is the coupling strength between two sites and $h$ is the external magnetic field.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa notebook na ito, ginagamit natin ang Ising model sa isang bilog na may 10 site:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{\\text{Ising}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{10} J_{i,(i+1)} Z_i Z_{(i+1)} + h_i X_i \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"
"kung saan ang mga periodic boundary conditions ay nagpapahiwatig na para sa $i=10$ ay makakakuha tayo ng $i+1=11\\rightarrow1$, $J$ ang coupling strength sa pagitan ng dalawang site at $h$ ang panlabas na magnetic field.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The observable we will measure is the total magnetization.\n"
msgstr "Ang observable na susukatin natin ay ang kabuuang magnetization.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Determine how much of the time evolution to simulate classically "
"{#determine-how-much-of-the-time-evolution-to-simulate-classically}"
msgstr ""
"Tukuyin kung gaano karaming time evolution ang i-simulate nang classical "
"{#determine-how-much-of-the-time-evolution-to-simulate-classically}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our overall goal is to simulate time evolution of the above model "
"Hamiltonian.  We do so by Trotter evolution, which we split into two "
"portions:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang ating pangkalahatang layunin ay i-simulate ang time evolution ng nasa "
"itaas na model Hamiltonian. Ginagawa natin ito sa pamamagitan ng Trotter "
"evolution, na hinahati natin sa dalawang bahagi:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An initial portion that is simulable with matrix product states (MPS).  We "
"will \"compile\" this portion using AQC as presented in "
"https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.08609.\n"
msgstr ""
"Isang inisyal na bahagi na maaaring i-simulate gamit ang matrix product "
"states (MPS). \"I-compile\" natin ang bahaging ito gamit ang AQC tulad ng "
"ipinakita sa https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.08609.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. A subsequent portion of the circuit that will be executed on hardware.\n"
"Let's plan to use AQC-Tensor to compress our time evolution circuit up to time $t=4$, then evolve using ordinary Trotter steps up to $t=5$.\n"
msgstr ""
"2. Isang sumusunod na bahagi ng circuit na isasagawa sa hardware.\n"
"Magplano tayong gumamit ng AQC-Tensor upang i-compress ang ating time evolution circuit hanggang $t=4$, pagkatapos ay mag-evolve gamit ang ordinaryong mga Trotter step hanggang $t=5$.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate circuits before and after split {#generate-circuits-before-and-"
"after-split}"
msgstr ""
"Bumuo ng mga circuit bago at pagkatapos ng split {#generate-circuits-before-"
"and-after-split}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now that we have chosen to split at $t=4$, we will generate two circuits:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ngayong pinili na natin na maghati sa $t=4$, bubuo tayo ng dalawang "
"circuit:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A \"target\" circuit for the AQC portion of the evolution, from $t_i=0$ to "
"$t_f=4$.  Because this is being simulated by a tensor-network simulator, the"
" number of layers affects execution time only by a constant factor, so we "
"might as well use a generous number of layers to minimize Trotter error.\n"
msgstr ""
"Isang \"target\" circuit para sa AQC na bahagi ng evolution, mula $t_i=0$ "
"hanggang $t_f=4$. Dahil ito ay sini-simulate ng tensor-network simulator, "
"ang bilang ng mga layer ay nakakaapekto lamang sa execution time sa "
"pamamagitan ng constant factor, kaya maaari nating gamitin ang isang bukas-"
"palad na bilang ng mga layer upang mabawasan ang Trotter error.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A subsequent evolution circuit, which evolves from $t_i=4$ to $t_f=5$.  "
"Because this is being run on quantum hardware, it is desirable to use as few"
" Trotter layers as possible.\n"
msgstr ""
"Isang sumusunod na evolution circuit, na nag-evolve mula $t_i=4$ hanggang "
"$t_f=5$. Dahil ito ay tinatakbo sa quantum hardware, kanais-nais na gumamit "
"ng kakaunting Trotter layer hangga't maaari.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For the sake of later comparison, let's also generate a third circuit: one "
"that evolves for `aqc_evolution_time` but which has the same evolution time "
"per Trotter step as the subsequent circuit.  This is the circuit we would "
"have working with had we not used a generous number of Trotter steps for the"
" target circuit.  We will refer to this as the _comparison circuit_.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa kapakanan ng paghahambing mamaya, bumuo rin tayo ng pangatlong "
"circuit: isa na nag-e-evolve para sa `aqc_evolution_time` ngunit may "
"parehong evolution time bawat Trotter step gaya ng subsequent circuit. Ito "
"ang circuit na pagtatrabahuhan natin kung hindi tayo gumamit ng bukas-palad "
"na bilang ng mga Trotter step para sa target circuit. Tatawagin natin itong "
"_comparison circuit_.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate an ansatz and initial parameters from a Trotter circuit with fewer "
"steps {#generate-an-ansatz-and-initial-parameters-from-a-trotter-circuit-"
"with-fewer-steps}"
msgstr ""
"Bumuo ng ansatz at mga inisyal na parameter mula sa Trotter circuit na may "
"mas kaunting steps {#generate-an-ansatz-and-initial-parameters-from-a-"
"trotter-circuit-with-fewer-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, we construct a \"good\" circuit that has the same evolution time as "
"the target circuit, but with fewer Trotter steps (and thus fewer layers).\n"
msgstr ""
"Una, gumagawa tayo ng \"magandang\" circuit na may parehong evolution time "
"bilang ang target circuit, ngunit may mas kaunting Trotter steps (at sa "
"gayon ay mas kaunting layer).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then we pass this \"good\" circuit to AQC-Tensor's `generate_ansatz_from_circuit` function.  This function analyzes the two-qubit connectivity of the circuit and returns two things:\n"
"1. a general, parametrized ansatz circuit with the same two-qubit connectivity as the input circuit; and,\n"
"2. parameters that, when plugged into the ansatz, yield the input (good) circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos ay ipapasa natin ang \"magandang\" circuit na ito sa `generate_ansatz_from_circuit` function ng AQC-Tensor. Ang function na ito ay sinusuri ang two-qubit connectivity ng circuit at nagbabalik ng dalawang bagay:\n"
"1. isang general, parametrized ansatz circuit na may parehong two-qubit connectivity gaya ng input circuit; at,\n"
"2. mga parameter na, kapag ipinasok sa ansatz, ay nag-yi-yield ng input (magandang) circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Soon we will take these parameters and iteratively adjust them to bring the "
"ansatz circuit as close as possible to the target MPS.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa lalong madaling panahon, kukunin natin ang mga parameter na ito at "
"iteratibong i-aadjust ang mga ito upang dalhin ang ansatz circuit nang "
"kasinglapit hangga't maaari sa target MPS.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/aqc-tensor/01-initial-state-"
"aqc/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/aqc-tensor/01-initial-state-"
"aqc/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Choose settings for tensor network simulation {#choose-settings-for-tensor-"
"network-simulation}"
msgstr ""
"Pumili ng settings para sa tensor network simulation {#choose-settings-for-"
"tensor-network-simulation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, we use the tensor network simulator based on "
"[quimb](http://quimb.readthedocs.io/). In this example, we use quimb's "
"matrix-product state (MPS) simulator, and we use "
"[JAX](https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/) for automatic differentiation. See "
"the [API "
"documentation](../stubs/qiskit_addon_aqc_tensor.simulation.quimb.QuimbSimulator.rst)"
" for more information on how to use the quimb simulator.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dito, gumagamit tayo ng tensor network simulator na nakabatay sa "
"[quimb](http://quimb.readthedocs.io/). Sa halimbawang ito, ginagamit natin "
"ang matrix-product state (MPS) simulator ng quimb, at ginagamit natin ang "
"[JAX](https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/) para sa automatic differentiation. "
"Tingnan ang [API "
"documentation](../stubs/qiskit_addon_aqc_tensor.simulation.quimb.QuimbSimulator.rst)"
" para sa karagdagang impormasyon kung paano gamitin ang quimb simulator.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Construct matrix-product state representation of the AQC target state "
"{#construct-matrix-product-state-representation-of-the-aqc-target-state}"
msgstr ""
"Bumuo ng matrix-product state representation ng AQC target state "
"{#construct-matrix-product-state-representation-of-the-aqc-target-state}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we build a matrix-product representation of the state to be "
"approximated by AQC.\n"
msgstr ""
"Susunod, bumuo tayo ng matrix-product representation ng state na ia-"
"approximate ng AQC.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that because we chose a generous number of Trotter steps for the target"
" state, it actually has less Trotter error than the comparison circuit.  We "
"can calculate the fidelity ($| \\langle \\psi_1 | \\psi_2 \\rangle |^2$) of "
"the state prepared by the comparison circuit vs. the target state:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tandaan na dahil pumili tayo ng bukas-palad na bilang ng mga Trotter step "
"para sa target state, ito ay talagang may mas mababang Trotter error kaysa "
"sa comparison circuit. Maaari nating kalkulahin ang fidelity ($| \\langle "
"\\psi_1 | \\psi_2 \\rangle |^2$) ng state na inihanda ng comparison circuit "
"kumpara sa target state:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Optimize the parameters of the ansatz using MPS calculations {#optimize-the-"
"parameters-of-the-ansatz-using-mps-calculations}"
msgstr ""
"I-optimize ang mga parameter ng ansatz gamit ang MPS calculations "
"{#optimize-the-parameters-of-the-ansatz-using-mps-calculations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, we minimize the simplest possible cost function, "
"`MaximizeStateFidelity`, by using the L-BFGS optimizer from scipy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dito, mini-minimize natin ang pinakasimpleng posibleng cost function, "
"`MaximizeStateFidelity`, sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng L-BFGS optimizer mula"
" sa scipy.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We choose a stopping point for the fidelity such that it will be above what "
"the comparison circuit would have been, without using AQC.  Once this is "
"reached, the compressed circuit has less Trotter error _and_ less depth than"
" the original circuit.  Given more processing time, further optimization "
"steps can be performed to bring the fidelity even higher.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pumipili tayo ng stopping point para sa fidelity na mas mataas kaysa sa kung"
" ano ang naging halaga ng comparison circuit, nang hindi gumagamit ng AQC. "
"Kapag naabot ito, ang compressed na circuit ay may mas mababang Trotter "
"error _at_ mas mababang depth kaysa sa orihinal na circuit. Sa karagdagang "
"processing time, maaaring magsagawa ng karagdagang mga optimization step "
"upang dalhin ang fidelity nang mas mataas pa.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Construct the final circuit to pass to the transpiler {#construct-the-final-"
"circuit-to-pass-to-the-transpiler}"
msgstr ""
"Buuin ang final na circuit na ipapasa sa transpiler {#construct-the-final-"
"circuit-to-pass-to-the-transpiler}"

