#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/aqc-tensor/01-initial-state-"
"aqc/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/aqc-tensor/01-initial-state-"
"aqc/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Transpile for execution on target hardware {#step-2-transpile-for-"
"execution-on-target-hardware}"
msgstr ""
"Hakbang 2: I-transpile para sa execution sa target hardware "
"{#step-2-transpile-for-execution-on-target-hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In Step 2 of a [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns), we  "
"transpile this circuit and any desired observable(s) for execution on a "
"target device.  Here we are using a fake backend provided by `qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa Hakbang 2 ng isang [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns), ti-"
"transpile natin ang circuit na ito at anumang nais na observable(s) para sa "
"execution sa isang target device. Dito gumagamit tayo ng fake backend na "
"ibinigay ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The resulting ISA circuit can then be sent for execution on the backend "
"(step 3 of a [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang resultang ISA circuit ay maaaring ipadala para sa execution sa backend "
"(hakbang 3 ng isang [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns)).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute on quantum hardware {#step-3-execute-on-quantum-hardware}"
msgstr ""
"Hakbang 3: Isagawa sa quantum hardware {#step-3-execute-on-quantum-hardware}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Reconstruct {#step-4-reconstruct}"
msgstr "Hakbang 4: Reconstruct {#step-4-reconstruct}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Reconstruction is not necessary in our case.  We can just look at the "
"result.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hindi kinakailangan ang reconstruction sa kaso natin. Maaari nating tingnan "
"na lang ang resulta.\n"

